# config/privacy-ground.list.example -- operator-designated ground privacy list (2026-10-23).
# Install as /etc/corporatetraveldc/privacy-ground.list (root-owned, 0640; the operator
# account must be able to read it for push-time checks). One entry per line; # comments.
# Read by scripts/leak-guard/privacy_lists.py: matched only in ground context, reported as
# 'ground-identifier', values never printed. Missing or empty file = "no entries"
# (reported, never a failure). Real entries never go in this tracked example.
#
# id:<identifier>    matched only after a ground key (plate, license_plate, vehicle,
#                    vehicle_id, vin)
# Synthetic examples, left commented:
# id:QQ-SYN-0001
# id:QZZ0000
